This repository ships only the project's own source (src/, tests/, docs/).

Third-party libraries (pyusb, libusb-package, dearpygui, numpy, pydantic) are
declared as dependencies in pyproject.toml and are not vendored here; each
remains under its own licence.

The Assetto Corsa telemetry struct layouts in src/openpulse/telemetry/ac/ were
cross-checked against two community references — mdjarv/assettocorsasharedmemory
(shared memory) and rickwest/ac-remote-telemetry-client (UDP). No code from
those projects is included; the layouts describe the game's own wire format.
